                                <button v-if="can.cbs" type="button" class="btn btn-outline-warning btn-sm"
                                    :disabled="isTicketBusy(t.id, 'cbs')" @@click="forceCbs(t)">
                                    <span v-if="isTicketBusy(t.id, 'cbs')" class="spinner-border spinner-border-sm"></span>
                                    <span v-else><i class="bi bi-currency-exchange me-1"></i>ضغط شحنة CBS</span>
                                </button>
                                <button v-if="can.hlr" type="button" class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm"
                                    :disabled="isTicketBusy(t.id, 'hlr')" @@click="hlrResync(t)">
                                    <span v-if="isTicketBusy(t.id, 'hlr')" class="spinner-border spinner-border-sm"></span>
                                    <span v-else><i class="bi bi-broadcast me-1"></i>مزامنة HLR</span>
                                </button>
                                <button v-if="can.escalate" type="button" class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-sm"
                                    :disabled="isTicketBusy(t.id, 'escalate')" @@click="escalateTicket(t)">
                                    <span v-if="isTicketBusy(t.id, 'escalate')" class="spinner-border spinner-border-sm"></span>
                                    <span v-else><i class="bi bi-arrow-up-circle me-1"></i>تصعيد Tier-3</span>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                            <p v-else class="small text-muted mb-0"><i class="bi bi-lock me-1"></i>التذكرة مغلقة — لا إجراءات تشغيلية.</p>
                            <p v-if="!can.cbs && !can.hlr && !can.escalate && t.canOperate" class="small text-warning mb-0 mt-2">
                                <i class="bi bi-shield-exclamation me-1"></i>لا توجد صلاحيات RBAC لإجراءات التذاكر على حسابك.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </template>
    </div>

    <!-- AI Voice Wizard Modal -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="c360AiWizardModal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg">
            <div class="modal-content border-0 shadow">
                <div class="modal-header border-0" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--sys-brand-red),var(--sys-brand-red-hover));color:var(--sys-card-bg);">
                    <h5 class="modal-title"><i class="bi bi-robot me-2"></i>محاكاة مكالمة كول سنتر AI</h5>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-4">
                    <p class="small text-muted mb-3">يُنشئ تذكرة آلية مربوطة بالمشترك الحالي وتظهر فوراً في تبويب الشكاوى.</p>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label small fw-semibold">MSISDN</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control font-monospace" v-model="state.aiSim.msisdn" dir="ltr" />
